        "TileImage": "$($repository f2f2bdc8-281a-48c8-9606-77a0413c0d24).Image",
        "Description": "Emetic toxins are not meant to kill — they are meant to create the perfect line of sight. Force three targets into isolation, but remember that timing and crowd control are everything.\r\rSilent Assassin, Suit Only. Deliver three flawless sniper headshots in close quarters. No missed shots, no bodies found, no pacifications etc.\r\rControl the room, 47.",
